#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""vpn-ns-qt: Python/Qt6 server picker for the vpn-ns Mullvad namespace.

Countries (flags) > cities > servers (owned/rented, provider, Gbps), live search, one click switches.
Same features as the Rust version (vpn-ns-gui), but edit-and-reopen: no compile step.
All VPN work is done by the `vpn-ns` script next to this file; this program is only the front end.
Needs: python3-pyqt6 (apt).
"""
